{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30259","headline":"题独孤处士村居 · 薛逢","name":"题独孤处士村居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江上园卢荆作扉，男驱耕犊妇鸣机。\n林峦当户茑萝暗，桑柘绕村姜芋肥。\n几亩稻田还谓业，两间茆舍亦言归。\n何如一被风尘染，到老云云相是非。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30259.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30259","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}